# Field Notes — the marketing blog.
#
# Drop a .md file in here and it appears at /blog and /blog/<filename> on the
# next build. No database, no admin screen: these are our own posts, so they
# live with the code that renders them.
#
# Front matter (all optional except title):
#
#   ---
#   title: What 3,000 crawls taught us about title tags
#   excerpt: One line, used on the index card and as the meta description.
#   category: Technical SEO
#   date: 2026-07-14
#   readMinutes: 6
#   featured: true
#   ---
#
#   Body is plain markdown from here down. Headings, lists, tables, quotes and
#   links all render — same renderer the generated posts use.
#
# `featured: true` promotes one post to the large card at the top of /blog.
# If several are marked, the newest wins.
